        {
          "name": "Task Dependency",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Test circular dependency Task",
              "item": [
                {
                  "name": "Circular C",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "POST",
                    "header": [],
                    "body": {
                      "mode": "raw",
                      "raw": "{\r\n  \"dependsOnTaskId\": \"{{taskA}}\"\r\n}",
                      "options": {
                        "raw": {
                          "language": "json"
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskC}}/dependencies",
                      "host": [
                        "{{baseUrl}}"
                      ],
                      "path": [
                        "tasks",
                        "{{taskC}}",
                        "dependencies"
                      ]
                    },
                    "description": "Task A → Task B  \nTask B → Task C\n\nHasil yang diharapkan: `409 Conflict`  \n  \n{  \n\"success\": false,  \n\"message\": \"Task dependency creates a circular dependency\"  \n}"
                  },
                  "response": []
                },
                {
                  "name": "Status Done A by Dependency",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "PATCH",
                    "header": [],
                    "body": {
                      "mode": "raw",
                      "raw": "{\r\n  \"status\": \"DONE\"\r\n}",
                      "options": {
                        "raw": {
                          "language": "json"
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskA}}",
                      "host": [
                        "{{baseUrl}}"
                      ],
                      "path": [
                        "tasks",
                        "{{taskA}}"
                      ]
                    },
                    "description": "### Test status DONE berdasarkan dependency\n\nMisalnya `Task A → Task B`, sementara Task B masih `TODO`.  \nHasil yang diharapkan: `409 Conflict`\n\n{  \n\"success\": false,  \n\"message\": \"A task cannot be marked as DONE while a dependency is incomplete\"  \n}"
                  },
                  "response": []
                },
                {
                  "name": "Status Done B by Dependency Copy",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "PATCH",
                    "header": [],
                    "body": {
                      "mode": "raw",
                      "raw": "{\r\n  \"dependsOnTaskId\": \"{{taskA}}\"\r\n}",
                      "options": {
                        "raw": {
                          "language": "json"
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskB}}",
                      "host": [
                        "{{baseUrl}}"
                      ],
                      "path": [
                        "tasks",
                        "{{taskB}}"
                      ]
                    },
                    "description": "Selesaikan Task B terlebih dahulu:  \n{  \n\"status\": \"DONE\"  \n}\n\nSetelah itu Task A boleh menjadi `DONE`.\n\nJika Task B kemudian dibuka lagi:\n\n{  \n\"status\": \"IN_PROGRESS\"  \n}\n\nmaka Task A yang bergantung padanya akan otomatis kembali menjadi `IN_PROGRESS`."
                  },
                  "response": []
                }
              ]
